WEBVTT

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:01.536
Father Morrisroe, who had recently
come to the county,

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:07.416
Joyce Bailey, a local 17-year-old girl

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.520
and I to go and get the drinks.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.240
When we got to the door,

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:18.696
a white man was standing
in the doorway with a shotgun,

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:23.200
and he said, "Bitch,
I'll blow your brains out!"

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:27.736
And before I could even react,

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.616
before I could even process
what was going on,